#Jeddah | His Royal Highness Minister of Foreign Affairs Prince #Faisal_bin_Farhan 
@FaisalbinFarhan
 meets with Her Excellency the Minister of Foreign Affairs, Trade, and Defense of the Republic of Ireland, Ms. Helen McEntee.

Under the patronage of Shamsa bint Hamdan bin Mohammed, The Christo and Jeanne-Claude Award 2026, presented by 
@NYUAbuDhabi
 in partnership with 
@ADMAFsocial
, has been awarded to UAE-based artists Noora Jabir and Moufida Mohideen for their work titled Everyday Artifacts.

In his capacity as Chairman of 
@ADJD_Official
, Mansour bin Zayed has issued a resolution establishing a specialised court for human trafficking crimes in Abu Dhabi, advancing efforts to strengthen a specialised judicial system and provide highest standards of timely justice.
